        {
          "title": "跨国外卖",
          "content": "<p>美国和墨西哥的边境墙聚集了很多等待过境的难民，他们又饿又渴，但又不愿离开。</p>\n<p>有人拿出手机，在墨西哥网上点餐，让美国的送餐员隔着边境墙送餐。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023051208.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023051209.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023051210.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
